*> Acceptance test, the witch's thrown potions (docs/protocol/20 section 11, 17 section 3.15, 44 section 6.5; lane 002-lane-mobsb5, T8910): the potion choice, the aim and speed, the
*> flight with gravity 0.05 and drag 0.99, the shatter with intensity 1 - distance / 4 on players and mobs, and a throw at a player.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ACC-US15-WITCH-POTION.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY BRWORLD.
 COPY EVKSTATE.
 01 WS-PLAYER              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DIM                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-ENTITY-ROW          PIC X(66).
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-WTYPE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-VTYPE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-W                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-V                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-POTION              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-RAIDER              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-HEALTH              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-D                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-SLOW                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-POISON              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-WEAK                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ROLL                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-VX                  FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-VY                  FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-VZ                  FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-SPEED               FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-X                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Y                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Z                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-X0                  FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Z0                  FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 01 WS-LEVEL               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LEFT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-POISON-ID           BINARY-LONG VALUE 18.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-H0                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BX                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BY                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BZ                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OWNER               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "MS-TEST-OPEN" USING WS-PLAYER
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE PL-DIM(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-DIM
     MOVE "minecraft:witch" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-WTYPE WS-ENTITY-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE "minecraft:villager" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-VTYPE WS-ENTITY-ROW WS-STATUS
*>   The choice (raider target 0/1, health, distance, has slowness, poison, weakness, roll in thousandths).
     MOVE 0 TO WS-RAIDER WS-SLOW WS-POISON WS-WEAK WS-ROLL
     MOVE 5 TO WS-HEALTH
     MOVE 5 TO WS-D
     CALL "WITCH-THROW-PICK" USING WS-RAIDER WS-HEALTH WS-D WS-SLOW WS-POISON WS-WEAK WS-ROLL WS-POTION
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 the default potion is Harming" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-POTION TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 9 TO WS-D
     CALL "WITCH-THROW-PICK" USING WS-RAIDER WS-HEALTH WS-D WS-SLOW WS-POISON WS-WEAK WS-ROLL WS-POTION
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 from 8 blocks on Slowness" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 4 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-POTION TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-SLOW
     MOVE 20 TO WS-HEALTH
     CALL "WITCH-THROW-PICK" USING WS-RAIDER WS-HEALTH WS-D WS-SLOW WS-POISON WS-WEAK WS-ROLL WS-POTION
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 slowed with health 8 or more: Poison" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 5 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-POTION TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-POISON
     MOVE 2 TO WS-D
     MOVE 100 TO WS-ROLL
     CALL "WITCH-THROW-PICK" USING WS-RAIDER WS-HEALTH WS-D WS-SLOW WS-POISON WS-WEAK WS-ROLL WS-POTION
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 within 3 blocks and the roll below 0.25: Weakness" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 6 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-POTION TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 300 TO WS-ROLL
     CALL "WITCH-THROW-PICK" USING WS-RAIDER WS-HEALTH WS-D WS-SLOW WS-POISON WS-WEAK WS-ROLL WS-POTION
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 a roll of 0.3 keeps Harming" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-POTION TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-RAIDER
     MOVE 4 TO WS-HEALTH
     CALL "WITCH-THROW-PICK" USING WS-RAIDER WS-HEALTH WS-D WS-SLOW WS-POISON WS-WEAK WS-ROLL WS-POTION
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 a raider at 4 health gets Healing" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 2 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-POTION TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 10 TO WS-HEALTH
     CALL "WITCH-THROW-PICK" USING WS-RAIDER WS-HEALTH WS-D WS-SLOW WS-POISON WS-WEAK WS-ROLL WS-POTION
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 a healthier raider gets Regeneration" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 3 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-POTION TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   Aim and speed.
     MOVE 5 TO WS-D
     CALL "POTION-SPEED" USING WS-D WS-SPEED
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 speed 0.75 beyond 2 blocks (milli)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 750 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N ROUNDED = WS-SPEED * 1000
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 2 TO WS-D
     CALL "POTION-SPEED" USING WS-D WS-SPEED
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 speed 0.45 within 2 blocks (milli)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 450 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N ROUNDED = WS-SPEED * 1000
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 5 TO WS-D
     MOVE 3 TO WS-X
     MOVE 0 TO WS-Y
     MOVE 4 TO WS-Z
     MOVE 750 TO WS-SPEED
     COMPUTE WS-SPEED = 0.75
     CALL "POTION-AIM" USING WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-D WS-SPEED WS-VX WS-VY WS-VZ
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 the aim raises y by d x 0.2 (vx in milli)" TO TL-CASE
     COMPUTE TL-EXPECTED-N ROUNDED = 0.75 * 3 / FUNCTION SQRT(26) * 1000
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N ROUNDED = WS-VX * 1000
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 vy in milli" TO TL-CASE
     COMPUTE TL-EXPECTED-N ROUNDED = 0.75 * 1 / FUNCTION SQRT(26) * 1000
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N ROUNDED = WS-VY * 1000
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   Splash: a player whose box is 2 blocks from the impact gets poison for 900 x 0.5 = 450 ticks.
     MOVE PL-X(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-X0
     MOVE PL-Z(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-Z0
     MOVE PL-Y(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-Y
     COMPUTE WS-X = WS-X0 - 2.3
     MOVE 5 TO WS-POTION
     CALL "WITCH-POTION-SPLASH" USING WS-DIM WS-X WS-Y WS-Z0 WS-POTION WS-OWNER
     CALL "EFFECT-LEVEL" USING WS-PLAYER WS-POISON-ID WS-LEVEL WS-LEFT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 17§3.15 intensity 0.5 gives 450 ticks of Poison" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 450 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-LEFT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   A villager 2 blocks away takes (int)(6 x 0.5 + 0.5) = 3 from Harming; one 4.4 blocks away nothing.
     COMPUTE WS-X = WS-X0 + 40
     CALL "MOB-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-VTYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z0 WS-YAW WS-V
     COMPUTE WS-X = EN-X(WS-V) - 2.3
     MOVE 1 TO WS-POTION
     CALL "WITCH-POTION-SPLASH" USING WS-DIM WS-X WS-Y WS-Z0 WS-POTION WS-OWNER
     MOVE "acceptance US15 17§3.15 Harming at intensity 0.5 hurts 3" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 17 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-HEALTH(WS-V) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE EN-HEALTH(WS-V) TO WS-H0
     MOVE 0 TO EN-HURT(WS-V)
     COMPUTE WS-X = EN-X(WS-V) - 4.7
     CALL "WITCH-POTION-SPLASH" USING WS-DIM WS-X WS-Y WS-Z0 WS-POTION WS-OWNER
     MOVE "acceptance US15 17§3.15 beyond 4 blocks nothing happens" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE WS-H0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-HEALTH(WS-V) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   A witch throws at the player 6 blocks away over a floor: the potion flies, lands and the player is poisoned or slowed (health 20, d < 8: Poison).
     COMPUTE WS-BX = FUNCTION INTEGER(WS-X0) - 20
     COMPUTE WS-BY = FUNCTION INTEGER(WS-Y) - 1
     COMPUTE WS-BZ = FUNCTION INTEGER(WS-Z0) - 20
     CALL "MS-TEST-FLOOR" USING WS-DIM WS-BX WS-BZ 40 WS-BY 1
     CALL "EFFECT-REMOVE" USING WS-PLAYER WS-POISON-ID
     COMPUTE WS-X = WS-X0 + 6
     CALL "MOB-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-WTYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z0 WS-YAW WS-W
     MOVE WS-PLAYER TO EN-TARGET(WS-W)
     MOVE 20 TO PL-HEALTH(WS-PLAYER)
     CALL "WITCH-THROW" USING WS-W
     MOVE 0 TO WS-H0
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > PZ-MAX
         ADD PZ-USED(WS-I) TO WS-H0
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 a potion is in flight after the throw" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-H0 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 the witch's timer is 60" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 60 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-SHOOT-TIME(WS-W) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     PERFORM 60 TIMES
         CALL "POTIONS-TICK"
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE 0 TO WS-H0
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > PZ-MAX
         ADD PZ-USED(WS-I) TO WS-H0
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 the potion has shattered" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-H0 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "EFFECT-LEVEL" USING WS-PLAYER WS-POISON-ID WS-LEVEL WS-LEFT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§11 the player is poisoned" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-LEVEL TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     STOP RUN.
 END PROGRAM ACC-US15-WITCH-POTION.

 COPY CORETEST.
 COPY MOBSPTEST.
